{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "22092d9ace31d06df44625c51ddb78af1c1956fbd4a1f549c4fac0184351bf58", "ja": "『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』！", "zh": "《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "8844a8f89fdcf1f495edd2475d3bc32f5cc3be0b8368bd95eaecfd1737e7ba9c", "ja": "さて、ここで番組からお知らせがあります！", "zh": "那么，接下来由节目为大家播报一则通知！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "58ee0f6dbf77e55600535fb1a951ecf2d10bc21286735147c0d74e20eee6c7b5", "ja": "はい！　私たちの主演ドラマ\n『咲くは浮世の君花火』関連グッズが発売中だよ！", "zh": "没错！我们主演的电视剧《绽放吧，浮世之君花火》相关周边正在发售哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "cf142f862b1246fedaa37f583cf14aa350d7b12b38fcccd1ad1605a01987025d", "ja": "ドラマの主題歌CDも、好評発売中ですよ！\nみなさん、よろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "电视剧主题曲CD也正在热卖哦！\n还请大家多多支持♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "949e7eb23997c6ff519e2b0a260d4394e7af7378856b672173262dfe56776543", "ja": "そして！　なんとなんと、私たち\n閃光☆HANABI団リバイバル公演が決定しました！", "zh": "而且！令人惊喜的是，我们\n闪光☆HANABI团的复刻公演确定啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "db80a53c3287fe019bfa8625c7a431a1739aac05985fc5c0f853866816ba0c89", "ja": "前回よりパワーアップしたステージになる予定なので、\nみなさん、楽しみにしていてください！", "zh": "这次的舞台预计会比上次更上一层楼，大家敬请期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "437d753ce50c6202e59c475d7b40d2e7b2345b008980f925e0e97321d49c3f96", "ja": "詳しくは、劇場の公式サイトやブログを\nチェックしてね！　よろしくっ☆", "zh": "详细内容请去剧场的官方网站和博客看看哦！拜托啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "5b3cf67552a3ba60344c90abc88af4c89b07c6bce9671f9c1d3a773b2b316323", "ja": "さて、そろそろ終わりの時間になりましたけど……\nふたりとも、宣伝番組をやってみて、どうだった？", "zh": "那么，差不多该到结束的时间了……\n你们两个试着做了宣传节目，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "9727b70d9d446edd87b21354e98f7e376de6dc4ecaebe2267ed008dd3d560aa2", "ja": "私は、始まる前はすこし緊張してましたけど……\nでもみんなと一緒だったから、すごく楽しかったです！", "zh": "开始之前我还有些紧张……\n不过因为和大家在一起，所以特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "a23238ce5263485861cd375d8a462d0ee39fd691b1f91567663b702fb30f9d8a", "ja": "私も私も！　中継とか、すっごく面白かったし！\n公演に向けて、パワーをもらっちゃったかも☆", "zh": "我也是我也是！转播什么的，超级有意思！\n好像还从中获得了为公演加油的力量呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "aa1586b8ef36467fcce0d8e47db8cbded88129b7f076bb0b7a43911f817f57c4", "ja": "中継といえば、大活躍のふたりにも聞かないと。\n奈緒ちゃん、のり子さん！　今日はどうでしたか？", "zh": "说到转播，也得问问表现活跃的两位才行。  \n奈绪、纪子！今天感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "bcff5316bd64c689c29b784abc1aaa0fc9e5329f2e992aa6d252e73e10de49fc", "ja": "もう終わりとか、早くない？\nアタシたちの出番、あっという間じゃなかった？", "zh": "这就结束了，也太快了吧？\n感觉我们的出场时间一眨眼就过去了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "bdeb1e01ec0c8e0d8d53bb6c0c79f0fe0efa1fc20bc7f6d7a11fd67625cc8cff", "ja": "ホンマやで。こっちはまだまだ話足りひんのに……\nせや！　このまま延長戦とかどう？", "zh": "确实是这样。明明我还没聊够呢……\n对了！就这样来个加时赛怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "bcfef0129469dc097bcf3a44f3e36825192110c0716a63234c55b93fd9be95b6", "ja": "うん。私たちも、そうしたいところなんだけど……\n放送時間が、決まっちゃってるみたい。", "zh": "嗯。我们也是很想这样的……\n但播出时间好像已经定死了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "5e8fde07d1c4c9ce625a4a9ca55c31774208645f9b6bebf04ad09a8490f8a282", "ja": "ダメか～。こうなったら、不完全燃焼分は\n公演で発散せんとな、のり子！", "zh": "不行吗～。既然这样，就得在公演上把这股没能尽兴的劲儿发泄出来了，法子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "96079574baf89edf8df550474b5ac492d5d6ad7b61a69d2d4d9ee96069041451", "ja": "うん、そうしよう！　……というわけで、\n今これを見てくれてる、みんな！　期待しててよね♪", "zh": "嗯，就这么办！……所以啊，\n现在正在看这个的各位！敬请期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "09b6d940b6e6f85ca00caf5bbdf308617b74628eafbaa7590220054a6ca0ea23", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさまでした！\n気をつけて帰ってきてくださいね！", "zh": "你们两位都辛苦了！\n回去路上请注意安全哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "19390e73338b36487233c21f8d90fce02e0b0d765ff060fb2691a6c8eba05f36", "ja": "さて、『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』は\nこれで終わりです。次は、公演でお会いしましょう！", "zh": "那么，《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》就到这里结束了。接下来，让我们在公演上见吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "8712e508b02ca9a1422f271703a576c0d7180757e786e2513a8a2755b66b4c1c", "ja": "でも、その前に……私たち閃光☆HANABI団の\n新しいMVが完成したので、お届けしちゃいますね♪", "zh": "不过在那之前……我们闪光☆HANABI团的新MV已经制作完成了，现在就为大家送上♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "e29350a6b24440fd8747706d00b09822a04fea9a64812956a9dc624e444cfbfd", "ja": "みんな、今日は本当にありがとーっ！\nまたね！", "zh": "大家，今天真的太感谢啦——！\n下次见咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "f9323928b7a11d34d173a9259d55b92a3aabb36fa34e86d8eb28cf18525337e7", "ja": "それでは、本日のお相手は。\n閃光☆HANABI団の高山紗代子と……。", "zh": "那么，今天陪伴大家的是——\n闪光☆HANABI团的高山纱代子，以及……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "6e6e81a3e81467a92aade21786757c74395298c0c4bd74961e78005ce91fe027", "ja": "同じく、佐竹美奈子と……。", "zh": "同样来自该组合的佐竹美奈子，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "d1bada35cb9ebd8ba4139d2c5b91b3aa4fcdf67bac59fb9692adc994ab6d8964", "ja": "高坂海美！　そしてそして……！", "zh": "高坂海美！接下来还有……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "69659a993d9b0617a35759d5d3b049e3bb8a7e737d37bc3e9793efedfa5f8556", "ja": "中継先から、横山奈緒と……！", "zh": "来自转播现场的横山奈绪以及……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "011bb4b3b669d869780552f9258ae630615db8e7bedb2085d44884f3c9f06410", "ja": "福田のり子、でお届けしましたー！", "zh": "福田法子，为您播报完毕——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_04_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "fbe26503a29bf1a3f45a9a7cf7077b6dc50ba74c804130f1b910e3d00a07bf99", "ja": "バイバーイ！", "zh": "拜拜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
